{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RocketShip Go Up</i> is a physics-based rocket piloting game where precision, timing, and control define your every move. Use thrusters to maneuver through intricate caverns, deliver packages, and avoid deadly hazards like beams, turrets, and falling debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Easy, Normal, or Hardcore difficulty to match your skill level\u2014accessible for novice pilots, but challenging enough for veterans. The core of the game revolves around mastering flight physics\u2014whether you're navigating delivery missions in Full Game Mode or chasing fastest completion times in Speedrun Mode. Each run is tracked on global leaderboards, so whether you\u2019re all about finesse or raw velocity, there\u2019s always someone to beat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877990?t=1758425939","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877990?t=1758425939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877990/45f34990b023beaa84bfa8e295a42477f4f5f4c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758425939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877990/45f34990b023beaa84bfa8e295a42477f4f5f4c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758425939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3943950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RocketShip Go Up</i> is a physics-based rocket piloting game where precision, timing, and control define your every move. Use thrusters to maneuver through intricate caverns, deliver packages, and avoid deadly hazards like beams, turrets, an